The overshoot-and-re-noise numerical update follows AMO Sampler:
Hu et al., AMO Sampler: Enhancing Text Rendering with Overshooting, CVPR 2025.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.19415
https://github.com/hxixixh/amo-release
ReentryMem supplies calibrated video-entity support and its presence-aware gating.

Changes in this inference snapshot: keep camera-text conditioning and checkpoint
parameter names; remove training launchers, optimizers, dataset caches, auxiliary
losses, intervention experiments and memory-module execution. Add standalone
condition-video inference, subject-region sampling and model-release tools.
